      "values:originalText": "(1B) If the Minister exercises the power under subsection (1A) in\nrelation to the applicant, then, for the purposes of section 21, the\napplicant is taken to satisfy the special residence requirement.",
      "skos:definition": "(1B) If the Minister exercises the power under subsection (1A) in\nrelation to the applicant, then, for the purposes of section 21, the\napplicant is taken to satisfy the special residence requirement.",
